@startuml address-states
' The address box. Colours: grey = showing the page, blue = focused,
' green = searching (dropdown), yellow = a suggestion highlighted.
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #52687A
  ArrowColor #52687A
  FontColor #182734
}
title The address box: states, keys, and what the badge shows

[*] --> Showing
state "Showing the page\nbadge: page identity (lock, file, shard…)\n~#url = page address (empty on gaze://newtab)" as Showing #EDEDED
state "Focused, unedited\nwhole address selected\nbadge: page identity" as Focused #DDEBF7
state "Searching\nbadge: magnifier\ndropdown when the text is non-empty" as Searching #E2EFDA
state "Highlighted(i)\nsuggestion i marked .on" as Highlighted #FFF2CC

Showing --> Focused : Ctrl+L\n(select_pending = url)
Showing --> Focused : click in the box
Focused --> Searching : typing, or the text is emptied
Searching --> Highlighted : ↓ (first) or ↑ (last)
Highlighted --> Highlighted : ↓ / ↑ (next_suggestion)
Highlighted --> Searching : ↓ past the last, ↑ past the first
Searching --> Showing : Enter: open the typed address
Highlighted --> Showing : Enter: switch to the open tab,\nor open the suggestion
Highlighted --> Showing : click a suggestion\n(Click is handled before Blur)
Searching --> Focused : Esc: put the address back,\nselect it all
Highlighted --> Focused : Esc
Focused --> Showing : Blur, Enter, or tab switch
Searching --> Showing : Blur (AddressDismiss)

note bottom of Searching
  A render never replaces what the user is typing:
  url_dirty waits while #url is focused with a query.
  The page's own address returns on Esc, Blur, Enter,
  or a tab switch (dismiss_address).
end note
@enduml
